# Response headers for Cloudflare Pages. Pages reads this file at build time and
# does not serve it. Paths are matched in order; `/*` is every response.
#
# The page loads nothing from anywhere else - no CDN, no scripts, no analytics.
# The policy below denies every fetch and then names the three the page actually
# makes: its own inline <style>, the favicon as a data: URI in the markup, and
# two woff2 files from this same origin. If a future edit adds an external
# asset, the browser will refuse to load it until this file says otherwise.
# That is the point.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src data:; font-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
